  and src/ are copied. Apache-2.0 (vendor/noir-bignum/LICENSE).

vendor/noir_bigcurve
  noir-lang/noir_bigcurve (https://github.com/noir-lang/noir_bigcurve), commit
  f9af3d8892db14c5f57d01e712455c1d6d9336f1, with its bignum dependency changed
  to the path of vendor/noir-bignum. Only Nargo.toml, README.md and src/ are
