  vendor/noir_bigcurve/LICENSE is the file added upstream in commit
  04b663b18ef2244f103faa5eff666927a1c65e17.

patches/bignum-prechecked.patch
  A change to noir-bignum made for this repository. It quotes upstream lines
  as context. scripts/vendor.sh rebuilds both vendor directories from the
  upstream commits and this patch, and checks that they match.

packages/zcash-storage-proofs/tests/fixtures/zip_0244.json, zip_0244.standard.json
