  78321beacb0e0477e33cd002b56585a107c2708c, MIT OR Apache-2.0.

packages/zcash-storage-proofs/tests/fixtures/mined-mainnet-1687106.hex
  Mainnet block 1,687,106 as published in ZcashFoundation/zebra, commit
  b643adb069bf68728ec244aee4d8013853060082 (zebra-test vectors), MIT OR
  Apache-2.0.

  Exact URLs and hashes of both are in
  packages/zcash-storage-proofs/tests/fixtures/public-source-manifest.json.

